  m_text: 'I hope you don''t mind filling in for me at the antique shop for a day.
    It''s important that you meet the daily quota of $2,000 USD. Check your balance
    in the top right corner.


    Your task is to decide whether to accept a deal
    or not. The potential profit for each deal is displayed in the top left corner.
    Be careful, many customers aren''t as innocent as they seem and might try to
    scam you with fake items. Figure out which ones are authentic. If you buy a fake,
    you''ll lose the money.


    How do you know if an item is real? Use your tools!
    The UV lamp, scales, and magnet will help you check an item''s weight and magnetic
    properties. Some objects also have labels or tiny text that you can read with
    the magnifying glass. Remember, you can always look up product information on
    the PC.


    I have to run now. Remember the quota, you need to hit it!


    All
    the best,'
